# AIPT - detection pack for LLM-driven autonomous pentest tools
# File:       aipt-target-facing.rules - Target-facing: tool and scanner fingerprints in requests to your own web servers
# Version:    1.0.0 (2026-10-12)
# License:    Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
# Engine:     Suricata 7.0 / 8.0 (validated with suricata -T and offline -r replay on 8.0.7)
# Message:    "AIPT <tool> <what>"; generic shapes use <tool> = Generic or Scanner.
# Metadata:   affected_product, attack_target, confidence, created_at, deployment, performance_impact, policy,
#             signature_severity, tag ai_pentest,
#             updated_at (Emerging Threats Open layout). Each rule is preceded by one comment line with its source
#             (upstream file:line at the commit in README.md, or the lab capture that established it).
# Policy:     metadata "policy block-eligible|alert|informational" (measured false-positive profile in
#             docs/fp-report.md). Every action stays alert. Only block-eligible sids (listed in
#             suricata/aipt-block-eligible.sids) are candidates for drop, per sensor, after the observe-mode baseline
#             and review of DEPLOYMENT.md.
# SID ranges: 9500001-9500099 ARTEX, 9500100-9500199 earlier comparison rules, 9500200-9500299 AI-pentest family
#             (CyberStrikeAI 9500200-9500219, HexStrike-AI 9500220-9500229, PentAGI 9500230-9500239, Strix 9500240-9500249,
#             Shannon 9500250-9500259, Villager 9500260-9500264, MetasploitMCP 9500265-9500279, generic MCP 9500280-9500289,
#             scanner shapes 9500290-9500299). Retired sids are listed in retired.rules and never reused.
# Deployment (one file per sensor position; load only what the sensor can see):
#   aipt-target-facing.rules    IDS in front of your own web servers (perimeter or reverse-proxy mirror): tool and
#                               scanner fingerprints in requests sent to your applications.
#   aipt-exposed-console.rules  datacenter / hosting / internal sensors that may see an operator console or tool API
#                               (ARTEX, CyberStrikeAI, HexStrike-AI, PentAGI, MetasploitMCP, MCP servers).
#   aipt-operator-egress.rules  egress sensors of networks where an operator could run one of these tools (update
#                               checks, vendor APIs, image pulls). Most of these services are HTTPS-only: the http
#                               rules need a TLS-inspecting proxy, the tls rules use SNI/certificates.
#   aipt-llm-side.rules         only where LLM API traffic is cleartext: TLS-terminating egress proxy, LLM relay or
#                               gateway, the provider, or a local model server (Ollama/vLLM). Needs large request
#                               body limits (see that file).
#   threshold.config: approved-assessment-suppress.threshold.template (generic sids only).

# ---- ARTEX (github.com/Autumn-27/ARTEX v0.3.15, e6ec569) ----
# source: enrich/enrich.go:233 (asset-enrichment prober, one GET per in-scope site)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT ARTEX Enrichment Prober User-Agent (artex-enrich)"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"artex-enrich/"; startswith; fast_pattern; reference:url,github.com/Autumn-27/ARTEX; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500001; rev:4; metadata:affected_product ARTEX, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy block-eligible, signature_severity Major, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: norma/tool/webfetch.go:188,195 (norma agent SDK WebFetch tool; any norma-based agent); an earlier local-model ARTEX lab run (2 requests)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT ARTEX Norma SDK WebFetch User-Agent (norma)"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"norma/"; startswith; fast_pattern; reference:url,github.com/Autumn-27/ARTEX; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500002; rev:4; metadata:affected_product ARTEX, attack_target Web_Server, confidence Medium, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: skills/api-recon/scripts/harvest_static.py:23 and spider_mpa.py:22 (both UAs share this prefix; 9500005 merged here)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT ARTEX api-recon Skill Script User-Agent (spa-api-recon)"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"Mozilla/5.0 (spa-api-recon"; startswith; fast_pattern; reference:url,github.com/Autumn-27/ARTEX; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500004; rev:4; metadata:affected_product ARTEX, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy block-eligible, signature_severity Major, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)

# ---- Generic shapes (supporting only; not attributable to one tool; honoured by the approved-assessment template) ----
# source: earlier local-model CyberStrikeAI lab run (nuclei and dirsearch probe manifest.json without Referer); lab runs 01 and 03. Not an ARTEX indicator: harvest_static.py
# parses webpack/Vite runtime chunk maps inside JS files and never requests a manifest.json.
# false-positive profile (docs/fp-report.md): also requires no Sec-Fetch-Dest header; browsers send it with manifest fetches, scanner templates do not
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Generic Web App Manifest Probe Without Referer"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.method; content:"GET"; http.uri; pcre:"/\/(?:asset-manifest\.json|\.vite\/manifest\.json|manifest\.json)(?:\?|$)/"; http.header_names; content:!"|0d 0a|Referer|0d 0a|"; nocase; content:!"|0d 0a|Sec-Fetch-Dest|0d 0a|"; nocase; threshold:type both, track by_src, count 2, seconds 60; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500006; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence Low, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy informational, signature_severity Informational, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: ARTEX Dockerfile:28 (Playwright), db/db.go:264 (browser MCP --headless); same UA for every Playwright/Puppeteer client
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Generic Headless Chromium User-Agent (browser automation)"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"HeadlessChrome/"; fast_pattern; threshold:type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 300; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500007; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence Low, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy informational, signature_severity Informational, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: lab runs 01-03 and the earlier local-model runs (path enumeration by agent-driven curl/python loops, nmap, dirsearch, nuclei); one alert per client per 60 s once 30 404s are reached
alert http $HOME_NET any -> any any (msg:"AIPT Generic HTTP 404 Burst to Single Client (path enumeration)"; flow:established,to_client; target:src_ip; http.stat_code; content:"404"; threshold:type both, track by_dst, count 30, seconds 60; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500008; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence Medium, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: ARTEX server/customtool.go:435-444 (custom http tools set no User-Agent); default UA of every Go program
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Generic Go-http-client Default User-Agent (Go agent tooling)"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.method; content:"GET"; http.user_agent; content:"Go-http-client/"; startswith; fast_pattern; threshold:type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 600; classtype:misc-activity; sid:9500010; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence Low, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy informational, signature_severity Informational, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: Nmap NSE http library UA; ARTEX image and CyberStrikeAI (tools/nmap.yaml -sV -sC) both run nmap; lab run 03 and the earlier local-model runs (with a hosted model ARTEX did not choose nmap)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Scanner Nmap Scripting Engine User-Agent"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"Nmap Scripting Engine"; fast_pattern; threshold:type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 300; reference:url,nmap.org/book/nse.html; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500110; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)

# ---- AI-pentest family: target-facing tool User-Agents ----
# source: CyberStrikeAI internal/handler/webshell.go:798, webshell_probe.go:93 (WebShell manager talking to an implanted shell)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT CyberStrikeAI WebShell Manager User-Agent"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"CyberStrikeAI-WebShell/"; fast_pattern; reference:url,github.com/AIPentest/CyberStrikeAI; classtype:trojan-activity; sid:9500207; rev:4; metadata:affected_product CyberStrikeAI, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy block-eligible, signature_severity Major, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: HexStrike-AI hexstrike_server.py:13287
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT HexStrike-AI HTTP Framework User-Agent"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"HexStrike-HTTP-Framework/"; startswith; fast_pattern; reference:url,github.com/0x4m4/hexstrike-ai; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500223; rev:4; metadata:affected_product HexStrike_AI, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy block-eligible, signature_severity Major, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: HexStrike-AI hexstrike_server.py:7098 (exact UA string, 32 bytes)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT HexStrike-AI Exploit Helper User-Agent (Compatible Exploit)"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"Mozilla/5.0 (Compatible Exploit)"; bsize:32; fast_pattern; reference:url,github.com/0x4m4/hexstrike-ai; classtype:web-application-attack; sid:9500224; rev:4; metadata:affected_product HexStrike_AI, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy block-eligible, signature_severity Major, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)

# ---- Scanners inherited by the whole family (generic; attribution comes from tool-specific rules in the same window) ----
# source: lab run 03 (nuclei default UA, an outdated Chrome 87 build string, on 32,450 requests; 58,123 in an earlier local-model run); a real Chrome 87 is end-of-life since 2021
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Scanner nuclei Default User-Agent (Chrome/87.0.4280.88)"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"Chrome/87.0.4280.88"; fast_pattern; threshold:type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 300; reference:url,github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500290; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence Medium, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: nuclei project UA (similar-tools.md 7 A.2)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Scanner nuclei Project User-Agent"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"Nuclei - Open-source project"; fast_pattern; threshold:type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 300; reference:url,github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500291; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: ffuf default UA (similar-tools.md 7 A.2)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Scanner ffuf User-Agent (Fuzz Faster U Fool)"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"Fuzz Faster U Fool"; fast_pattern; threshold:type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 300; reference:url,github.com/ffuf/ffuf; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500292; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: sqlmap default UA (similar-tools.md 7 A.2)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Scanner sqlmap User-Agent"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"sqlmap/"; startswith; fast_pattern; threshold:type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 300; reference:url,github.com/sqlmapproject/sqlmap; classtype:web-application-attack; sid:9500293; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: gobuster default UA (similar-tools.md 7 A.2)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Scanner gobuster User-Agent"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"gobuster/"; startswith; fast_pattern; threshold:type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 300; reference:url,github.com/OJ/gobuster; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500294; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: nikto UA token (similar-tools.md 7 A.2)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Scanner Nikto User-Agent"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.user_agent; content:"(Nikto/"; fast_pattern; threshold:type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 300; reference:url,github.com/sullo/nikto; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500295; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence High, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: lab run 05 (ZAP baseline spider: User-Agent header present with an empty value on 66 of 67 requests)
# false-positive profile (docs/fp-report.md): requests with Authorization or Cookie are not counted (authenticated API clients without a User-Agent)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Scanner Burst of Requests With Empty User-Agent"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.protocol; content:"HTTP/1."; startswith; http.user_agent; bsize:0; http.header_names; content:!"|0d 0a|Authorization|0d 0a|"; nocase; content:!"|0d 0a|Cookie|0d 0a|"; nocase; threshold:type both, track by_src, count 20, seconds 60; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500297; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence Low, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
# source: earlier local-model CyberStrikeAI lab run (UA-less scanner requests); raw nmap/nc-style probes send no User-Agent header at all
# false-positive profile (docs/fp-report.md): requests with Authorization or Cookie are not counted (.NET HttpClient sends no User-Agent by default)
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"AIPT Scanner Burst of Requests Without User-Agent Header"; flow:established,to_server; target:dest_ip; http.protocol; content:"HTTP/1."; startswith; http.header_names; content:!"|0d 0a|User-Agent|0d 0a|"; nocase; content:!"|0d 0a|Authorization|0d 0a|"; nocase; content:!"|0d 0a|Cookie|0d 0a|"; nocase; threshold:type both, track by_src, count 20, seconds 60; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9500299; rev:4; metadata:affected_product Any, attack_target Web_Server, confidence Low, created_at 2026_10_09, deployment Perimeter, performance_impact Low, policy alert, signature_severity Minor, tag ai_pentest, updated_at 2026_10_12;)
